When you start to use a specific crafting station, this addon will display your skill and CP information which is related to the current crafting station.
If you lack specific crafting skills, this addon will taunt you.

Now, this addon checks & displays 4 skills below.

Basic ( e.g. Metalworking )
Extracting ( e.g. Metal Extraction )
Improving ( e.g. Temper Expertise)
MeticulousDisassembly(CP. checking your CP point)

The check automatically starts when you interact with crafting stations below.

Blacksmithing
Clothing
Woodworking
Enchanting
Jewelry Crafting
Deconstruct Assistant

[B]DependsOn:[/B]

